# Downloaded sd-server/sd-cli release binary + shared library (staging
# prerequisite, recorded by tag/sha256 in the README, never committed).
bin/

# Downloaded model weights and LoRAs (staging prerequisite, recorded by
# identifier/size/sha256 in the README, never committed — multi-GB
# checkpoints have no place in a git repo).
models/

# Raw per-run measurement dumps and generated images (README is the durable
# record). The one exception is results/summary.json: a published aggregate
# of already-computed rates, percentiles, and counts (no image bytes) — it
# is NOT independently recomputable raw samples, only a durable record of
# numbers this probe already computed, so `bun run src/run.ts report` can
# still render the README on a fresh checkout that has none of the raw
# per-request records or generated images below.
results/*
!results/summary.json
!results/images/
results/images/*
# Three committed contact sheets (owner review, ≤400 KB each) — the only
# generated-image artifacts durable enough to keep: the recommended sd.cpp
# Q8_0 arm, the Draw Things add-on arm, and the sd.cpp Q4_0 arm kept
# specifically as visual evidence for the Caveat's LoRA-reliability finding
# (Q4_0's LoRA application is confirmed unreliable; this sheet is the
# supporting comparison, not a base-arm candidate). Every other raw
# per-run image/contact-sheet dump stays gitignored above.
!results/images/sdcpp-512-contact-sheet.png
!results/images/drawthings-512-contact-sheet.png
!results/images/sdcpp-q4-512-contact-sheet.png
